 </figure>
 
 
  <h2>Future development and usage perspectives</h2>
  <p>EJS is actively being developed. Version 5.3 introduced support for ePub and macOS widgets, and the upcoming version 6.0 includes a new editor and plugin system. Plans include separating Java and JavaScript versions, integrating with e-learning platforms, and adding support for data analysis from simulations.</p>

